        "content": "## JobPilot Site API\n\n**GET** `/webhook/jobpilot/applications`\n\nHeader: `X-JobPilot-Secret` = same as `JOBPILOT_INGEST_SECRET` in n8n Variables + site `.env.local`\n\nReturns all rows from **job_applications** data table.\n\n1. Set n8n Variable: `JOBPILOT_INGEST_SECRET`\n2. **Activate** this workflow\n3. Add Production URL to site `.env.local` as `N8N_APPLICATIONS_WEBHOOK_URL`",
